                    <occupation>Solicitor</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>This is someone on whom Godwin calls, but who never calls on Godwin and is very rarely
                            seen at the houses of others, strongly suggesting a professional
                            relationship. One candidate for this is Chapman Barber, a solicitor of
                            44 Chancery Lane. Godwin's first contact with him, suggests he was
                            visiting a number of people in the same or adjacent locations, around
                            the East End of the City. The identification of Barber is speculative but the pattern of visiting
                            does look very consistent, so that (even if not this Barber) we are dealing with a single individual.</p>
